<h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">Travel documents</h1>
<div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
	<section class="card"><h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold"><a class="text-brand underline" href="/renew">Renew a passport online</a></h2><p class="text-sm">If your current passport was issued in the last 15 years and isn’t damaged. Fee: $130.00, or $190.00 expedited.</p></section>
	<section class="card"><h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">First passport</h2><p class="text-sm">Apply in person at 1 Civic Plaza. Bring proof of citizenship and a photo ID. Appointments: 555-0150.</p></section>
	<section class="card"><h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">Lost or stolen passport</h2><p class="text-sm">Report it by phone at 555-0150, then apply in person for a replacement.</p></section>
</div>
